WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.669 --> 00:00:18.225
A workspace is one network. You can have several: a personal one, and one you share with a team.

2
00:00:18.225 --> 00:00:26.290
Workspace settings hold your own email addresses and your corporate domains. Changing the domains recomputes the Corporate circle for everyone.

3
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:39.062
Members shows who has access. The owner can invite people as editors, who can import and edit, or viewers, who can only look.

4
00:00:39.062 --> 00:00:56.284
If the person already has an account they join immediately. Otherwise you get an invite link to send them; it works once and lets them sign up straight into the workspace.

5
00:00:56.284 --> 00:01:04.248
New workspaces start empty. Switch between them with the menu at the top of the rail.

6
00:01:04.248 --> 00:01:07.356
Each workspace has its own people, integrations and members.
